<title>USA: Woodward Governor to trade on Nasdaq NMS.</title>
<headline>Woodward Governor to trade on Nasdaq NMS.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woodward Governor Co said Thursday it expects to begin trading its shares on the Nasdaq National Market by mid-January under the symbol WGOV.</p>
<p>The company also said its stockholders approved a four-for-one stock split, effective February 7 to shareholders of record January 23.</p>
<p>Woodward Governor is a manufacturer of aircraft control parts.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
